; SCRIPT-LESS, on the ENGINE's own OnHitEffect - onhit_rend_nexus.tres is the in-mod precedent.
; Nothing here needs code: apply_statuses_and_buffs sends the buff to the ATTACKED unit with
; context.gear as its source (on_hit_effect.gd:84-87), which is both halves of ruling 19's "to the
; TARGET, from_gear the sword".
;
; apply_on is OMITTED: STAGE.ON_HIT is the export's own default (on_hit_effect.gd:12) and ON_HIT is
; the card's stage. apply_buffs_to_self is OMITTED: false is the default, and false is the target.
[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_onhit")
buffs = Array[ExtResource("2_buff")]([ExtResource("3_chip")])
